<section class="product" id="shop">
  <div class="gallery">
    <div class="thumbs" id="thumbs">
      <button class="thumb active" onclick="setImage('assets/product-main.png',this)"><img src="assets/product-main.png" alt="123 piece track set"></button>
      <button class="thumb" onclick="setImage('assets/product-solo.png',this)"><img src="assets/product-solo.png" alt="Child playing with track"></button>
      <button class="thumb" onclick="setImage('assets/product-family.png',this)"><img src="assets/product-family.png" alt="Family playing with track"></button>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-image"><img id="mainImage" src="assets/product-main.png" alt="Magnetic Train Track Builder Set, 123 pieces"><span class="zoom-label">⌕ Click to zoom</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="product-info">
    <span class="pill">Best Seller</span>
    <h1 class="product-title">Magnetic Train Track Builder Set</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">123 Pieces | Creative Building Blocks for Kids</p>
    <div class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★★</span><strong>4.8</strong><span class="reviews">(124 reviews)</span></div>
    <div class="price-row"><span class="old">Rs. 9,500</span><span class="price">Rs. 6,500</span><span class="discount">32% OFF</span></div>
    <div class="stock-row"><span class="dot"></span><span id="stockText">In Stock | Only 5 left</span></div>
    <div class="stock-meter"><span id="stockBar"></span></div>
    <p class="description">Let your child's imagination go on tracks. Build colorful layouts, connect the pieces, create different routes and enjoy hands-on play with a fun magnetic track system.</p>
    <div class="benefits">
      <div class="benefit"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 3 20 6v5c0 5-3.4 8.4-8 10-4.6-1.6-8-5-8-10V6l8-3Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg><span>Safe &amp; Non-Toxic<br>Materials</span></div>
      <div class="benefit"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M8 4v6M16 14v6M6 10h4M14 14h4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M8 10a3 3 0 1 0 0 6M16 14a3 3 0 1 1 0-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg><span>Strong Magnetic<br>Connection</span></div>
      <div class="benefit"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M7 20v-4a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4M5 12a7 7 0 0 1 14 0" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg><span>Perfect For<br>Ages 3+</span></div>
      <div class="benefit"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 3l1.5 5.5L19 10l-5.5 1.5L12 17l-1.5-5.5L5 10l5.5-1.5L12 3Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg><span>Hours of<br>Creative Play</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="qty-row"><div class="qty"><button onclick="changeQty(-1)">−</button><span id="qty">1</span><button onclick="changeQty(1)">+</button></div></div>
    <div class="cta-grid"><button class="btn primary" onclick="addToCart()">🛒 Add to Cart</button><button class="btn buy" onclick="buyNow()">⚡ Buy Now</button><button class="btn wa-btn" onclick="orderWhatsApp()">◉ Chat on WhatsApp</button><button class="btn cod" onclick="orderWhatsApp()">▣ Cash on Delivery</button></div>
    <div class="delivery"><span>🚚 Free Delivery on Orders Above Rs. 5,000</span><span>↩ Easy 7 Days Return</span></div>
    <div class="check-note">Parcel open karke check kar sakte hain.</div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section" id="details">
  <div class="tabs"><button class="tab active" onclick="showTab(this,'tab-details')">Product Details</button><button class="tab" onclick="showTab(this,'tab-description')">Description</button><button class="tab" onclick="showTab(this,'tab-specs')">Specifications</button><button class="tab" onclick="showTab(this,'tab-shipping')">Shipping &amp; Returns</button></div>
  <div id="tab-details" class="tab-panel"><div class="detail-grid"><div class="detail-copy"><h2>Product Details</h2><p>The Magnetic Train Track Builder Set is designed for creative building and fun play. With 123 colorful pieces, kids can build their own track layouts, curves and routes. The magnetic connection makes the pieces easy to connect and rebuild.</p><p>Perfect for home play, gifting and family time.</p></div><div class="feature-box"><ul><li>123 pieces in the set</li><li>Colorful magnetic track pieces</li><li>Rechargeable cars included</li><li>Multiple track configurations</li><li>Suitable for ages 3+</li><li>Great for individual or family play</li></ul></div></div></div>
  <div id="tab-description" class="tab-panel" style="display:none"><div class="detail-copy"><h2>Build it. Change it. Play again.</h2><p>Connect the pieces, make a route and change it whenever you want. The modular design makes every build feel different.</p></div></div>
  <div id="tab-specs" class="tab-panel" style="display:none"><div class="feature-box"><ul><li>Set size: 123 pieces</li><li>Product type: Magnetic building track</li><li>Includes: Track pieces, accessories and rechargeable cars</li><li>Recommended age: 3+</li></ul></div></div>
  <div id="tab-shipping" class="tab-panel" style="display:none"><div class="detail-copy"><h2>Shipping &amp; Returns</h2><p>Cash on Delivery is available. Free shipping applies to orders above Rs. 5,000. Contact Brioys support on WhatsApp for order assistance.</p></div></div>
</section>
